---
import Avatar from '../../components/ui/Avatar.astro';
import AvatarGroup from '../../components/ui/AvatarGroup.astro';
import Card from '../../components/ui/Card.astro';
import Specimen from '../Specimen.astro';
---
<Specimen title="Initials" code={'<Avatar initials="AL" alt="Ada Lovelace" size="small" />\n<Avatar initials="GH" alt="Grace Hopper" />\n<Avatar initials="AT" alt="Alan Turing" size="large" />\n<Avatar initials="KJ" alt="Katherine Johnson" size="xlarge" />'}>
    <Fragment slot="notes">
        <p>Without an image, an avatar shows initials on the subtle primary disc. Four sizes: small (2rem), default (2.5rem), large (3rem) and extra large (4rem).</p>
        <p><code>alt</code> names the person: assistive technology reads the name, not the initials. Leave it empty only when the name is written beside the avatar.</p>
    </Fragment>
    <div class="row">
        <Avatar initials="AL" alt="Ada Lovelace" size="small" />
        <Avatar initials="GH" alt="Grace Hopper" />
        <Avatar initials="AT" alt="Alan Turing" size="large" />
        <Avatar initials="KJ" alt="Katherine Johnson" size="xlarge" />
    </div>
</Specimen>

<Specimen title="Images" code={'<Avatar src="/onixlabs/images/contributors/matt.jpeg" alt="Matthew" size="large" />'}>
    <Fragment slot="notes"><p>A photo fills the circle and is cropped to cover it. Square sources work best.</p></Fragment>
    <div class="row">
        <Avatar src="/onixlabs/images/contributors/matt.jpeg" alt="Matthew" size="small" />
        <Avatar src="/onixlabs/images/contributors/laura.jpeg" alt="Laura" />
        <Avatar src="/onixlabs/images/contributors/adam.jpeg" alt="Adam" size="large" />
        <Avatar src="/onixlabs/images/contributors/ryan.jpeg" alt="Ryan" size="xlarge" />
    </div>
</Specimen>

<Specimen title="Adornments" code={'<Avatar initials="AL" alt="Ada Lovelace" size="large">\n    <span class="badge badge-pill badge-success">3<span class="visually-hidden"> new</span></span>\n</Avatar>'}>
    <Fragment slot="notes"><p>The default slot is pinned to the bottom-right, outside the circular clip: a status badge or a small icon. Give it text that makes sense out of context.</p></Fragment>
    <div class="row">
        <Avatar initials="AL" alt="Ada Lovelace" size="large">
            <span class="badge badge-pill badge-success">3<span class="visually-hidden"> new</span></span>
        </Avatar>
        <Avatar src="/onixlabs/images/contributors/laura.jpeg" alt="Laura" size="large">
            <span class="status"><span class="visually-hidden">Online</span></span>
        </Avatar>
        <Avatar initials="GH" alt="Grace Hopper" size="large">
            <span class="status status-away"><span class="visually-hidden">Away</span></span>
        </Avatar>
    </div>
</Specimen>

<Specimen title="Groups" code={'<AvatarGroup label="Contributors" more={4}>\n    <Avatar src="…" alt="Matthew" />\n    <Avatar src="…" alt="Laura" />\n</AvatarGroup>'}>
    <Fragment slot="notes">
        <p>A group overlaps its avatars and rings each in the colour behind it. <code>more</code> adds a final count for the people not shown. The group is labelled, so it reads as one unit.</p>
        <p>Set <code>on="surface"</code> when the group sits on a card or tile, so the ring matches the surface.</p>
    </Fragment>
    <div class="stack">
        <AvatarGroup label="Contributors" more={4}>
            <Avatar src="/onixlabs/images/contributors/matt.jpeg" alt="Matthew" />
            <Avatar src="/onixlabs/images/contributors/laura.jpeg" alt="Laura" />
            <Avatar src="/onixlabs/images/contributors/adam.jpeg" alt="Adam" />
            <Avatar src="/onixlabs/images/contributors/ryan.jpeg" alt="Ryan" />
        </AvatarGroup>
        <div class="sample">
            <Card padded>
                <AvatarGroup label="Reviewers" on="surface" size="small" more={2}>
                    <Avatar initials="AL" alt="Ada Lovelace" size="small" />
                    <Avatar initials="GH" alt="Grace Hopper" size="small" />
                    <Avatar initials="AT" alt="Alan Turing" size="small" />
                </AvatarGroup>
            </Card>
        </div>
    </div>
</Specimen>

<Specimen title="On a dark band" surface="dark">
    <Fragment slot="notes"><p>Initials take the dark palette's subtle disc; the group ring follows the band.</p></Fragment>
    <div class="row">
        <Avatar initials="AL" alt="Ada Lovelace" size="large" />
        <AvatarGroup label="Contributors" more={2}>
            <Avatar src="/onixlabs/images/contributors/matt.jpeg" alt="Matthew" size="large" />
            <Avatar src="/onixlabs/images/contributors/laura.jpeg" alt="Laura" size="large" />
            <Avatar initials="GH" alt="Grace Hopper" size="large" />
        </AvatarGroup>
    </div>
</Specimen>

<style>
    .row {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .sample {
        max-width: 20rem;
    }

    .status {
        display: block;
        width: 0.8rem;
        height: 0.8rem;
        border-radius: 50%;
        corner-shape: round;
        background: var(--success);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--bg);
    }

    .status-away {
        background: var(--warning);
    }
</style>
